Third-party software in OpenVDDK binary builds

No third-party source code is copied into this source tree. The following
Go modules are compiled into the library (libvixDiskLib.so.8.0.3) and the
administrative program (openvddk-admin) when they are built. Their licence
texts follow. The versions are those pinned in go.mod and go.sum.

| Module | Version | Licence |
|---|---|---|
| Go standard library and runtime | 1.26.8 | BSD-3-Clause |
| github.com/vmware/govmomi | v0.56.0 | Apache-2.0 |
| github.com/google/uuid | v1.6.0 | BSD-3-Clause |
| golang.org/x/sys | v0.48.0 | BSD-3-Clause |

The library links dynamically against the system's GNU C Library (glibc,
LGPL-2.1-or-later), which is not distributed with OpenVDDK. Modules listed
in go.sum but used only by tests (for example gopkg.in/yaml.v3, MIT and
Apache-2.0) are not part of any binary build.

